Package: tvwcs-boot-logo
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: TVWCS <https://github.com/one-moment-please/tvwcs>
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/one-moment-please/tvwcs
Depends: plymouth, plymouth-label
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Description: The TVWCS logo while the computer starts, instead of the start-up text
 A Plymouth theme that shows the TVWCS logo on a black screen while the computer starts and shuts down. Installing it
 makes it the default theme and turns on GRUB's "splash" option; removing it puts the start-up text back.
